  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/lib.rs:37 — FORCE_CANCEL_DEADLINE=10s combined with GRACEFUL_DRAIN_DEADLINE=5s yields 16s worst-case shutdown time, violating the 5s clean-shutdown SLO defined in plan §5. Fix: reduce FORCE_CANCEL_DEADLINE or restructure shutdown stages to stay within the 5s SLO." ;
